& [ImplementationSubstratePack: IR1ImplementationSubstratePackV1] is the accepted boundary pack exported by IR1
  + [pack_id] is ir1-implementation-substrate-pack-v1
  + [pack_uuid] is 8165216a-8309-4cc1-8e18-65aef56d0295
  + [source_chunk] is IR1 implementation substrate and repository scaffold
  + [export_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [consumer_chunk] is scaffold execution and IR2 authority parser planning
  + [activation_effect] is inert scaffold file creation may proceed if it exactly matches the accepted scaffold file inventory and proof checklist
  + [implementation_effect] is no parser behavior, SQLite projection behavior, LangGraph runtime behavior, surface behavior, adapter behavior, operations simulator behavior, operations control, or live machine control is authorized by this pack

  = must: preserve Python as the substrate runtime and pyproject.toml as package metadata format
  = must: preserve docs/ as SOP authority and .langsop/ as generated projection root
  = must: preserve no-op side-effect-free scaffold placeholders only
  = must: preserve generated artifacts as projection-only and ignored by default
  - never: treat scaffold files, test smoke checks, generated artifacts, or package metadata as authority records by themselves

